ros-lyrical-rclcpp-cascade-lifecycle (2.0.7-1trixie) trixie; urgency=high

  * One version for Humble, Jazzy, Kilted and Lyrical. On Humble (from 1.1.0) the API does not change, but the class layout does: rebuild what was built against 1.1.0
  * Do not abort when the state timer runs after shutdown, and do not ask for the node names then (#25 <https://github.com/fmrico/cascade_lifecycle/issues/25>, #27 <https://github.com/fmrico/cascade_lifecycle/issues/27>)
  * Tests discover only nodes on this host (#23 <https://github.com/fmrico/cascade_lifecycle/issues/23>)
  * Tests with the SingleThreadedExecutor, 2 s per step: the experimental EventsExecutor is deprecated and Humble does not have it (#28 <https://github.com/fmrico/cascade_lifecycle/issues/28>)
  * Contributors: Francisco Martín Rico

